{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786659646729061001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"deferable-hemp-cockatiel","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":7},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Joe Oakhart","body":"Detached from epic tsunamic-wax-hog (which is now complete) so the parked idea survives as standalone future work rather than blocking the epic's close (child-closure invariant). Provenance kept via relates_to. Promote idea->open if Python-API/config-key inventory demand or drift pain emerges.","timestamp":1783867590178946001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","body":"Detached from epic tsunamic-wax-hog (complete) so this parked idea survives as standalone future work rather than blocking the epic close; provenance via relates_to. Promote idea->open if Python-API/config-key inventory demand emerges.","timestamp":1783867628107599001}],"created_at":1783814587887580001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"fb8b97ae-8e51-4dba-8cf3-050dc1a9671f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"4191-b4f9-146a-43cd"}],"description":"## What\n\nParking-lot (status `idea`) for the two lower-value interface inventories the audit\nalso proposed: a generated **Python public-API inventory** and a generated\n**config-key inventory**. These are deliberately NOT committed as active work yet —\nthe CLI and MCP references (sibling tickets) carry most of the client value, and the\nenv-var registry is already generated. Promote this to `open` only if there is\ndemonstrated reader demand or drift pain.\n\n## Rationale for parking (not shipping now)\n- `docs/config.md` is primarily a hand-authored design-of-record; a generated key\n  table would complement, not replace it — lower leverage than CLI/MCP.\n- The Python public API is comparatively stable and already described by\n  `docs/api-stability.md` / `docs/reuse-surface.md`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria (if promoted)\n- [ ] A generator emits `docs/config-reference.md` (config keys) and/or\n      `docs/python-api-reference.md`, each marked generated, with a CI drift gate.\n- [ ] Output derives from the config schema / public `__all__` respectively.\n\nFiles (if promoted): `scripts/gen_config_reference.py` (new),\n`scripts/gen_api_reference.py` (new), `docs/config-reference.md` (new),\n`docs/python-api-reference.md` (new), `.github/workflows/test.yml`.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"scripts/gen_config_reference.py","reason":"(if promoted) config-key generator"},{"path":"scripts/gen_api_reference.py","reason":"(if promoted) python-api generator"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","4191-b4f9-146a-43cd"],["relates_to","4191-b4f9-146a-43cd"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"","parent_status_uuid":"5331845e-adea-4555-aebb-b67ad9fda3fa","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":4,"reverts":[],"status":"idea","tags":["docs","idea"],"ticket_id":"a454-9285-b999-4ac5","ticket_type":"task","title":"idea: Generate Python public-API + config-key inventories (parking lot)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["609f5c7f-4010-4aa3-8b7a-e38fa00a5e34","5cbfd0a6-a19f-4d31-8b00-2c5935b50ca8","5331845e-adea-4555-aebb-b67ad9fda3fa","d768bb61-0730-4d73-94ee-e522798321d7","d4c7a2dc-bbaa-45c4-a58e-7e9717212a02","fb8b97ae-8e51-4dba-8cf3-050dc1a9671f","44a8c623-0aa2-4696-8133-2b4c04979e26"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659646729061001,"uuid":"0f286aec-5803-4de6-b308-79ecb577180d"}